<title>FINLAND: WARBURG, UBS ADVISERS ON RAUTARUUKKI FLOAT.</title>
<headline>WARBURG, UBS ADVISERS ON RAUTARUUKKI FLOAT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Finnish ministry of trade and industry said in a statement on Tuesday it had appointed SBC Warburg and Union Bank of Switzerland as its advisers regarding a potential further privatisation of steel group Rautaruukki Oy.  </p>
<p>&quot;No decisions have been made to expand the ownership base,&quot; the ministry said.</p>
<p>The Finnish state holds 68.7 percent of votes in Rautaruukki, and has an authorisation by parliament to cut the state's ownership to 33.4 percent.</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom  +358 - 9 - 680 50 245</p>
</text>
